+⛔⛔ **NO AMERICAN CANON, NO GENERAL CONVENTION ACT, AND NO INDIVIDUAL EPISCOPAL DIRECTIVE NAMING INCENSE WAS FOUND BY THIS PASS.** Multiple query formulations returned nothing. ⚠️ **This is a negative over the open web and two Pastoral Letters, and diocesan archives, convention journals and episcopal charges were NOT searched. A diocesan prohibition could exist. Recorded at §6 as undetermined, not as absent.**
