+⭐ **The Episcopal Missionary Church's episcopal lineage runs through the Protestant Episcopal Church in the United States, not through the Church of England.** Per the EMC's own published "About" page and corroborating reference sources:
+
+- The EMC was **incorporated in 1992**, an outgrowth of the **Episcopal Synod of America** (now Forward in Faith, North America), when **27 congregations withdrew from the Episcopal Church**.
+- Its first Presiding Bishop was **the Rt Rev. A. Donald Davies, retired Bishop of Fort Worth**, succeeded by **the Rt Rev. William W. Millsaps**; **the Rt Rev. Peter Ng'ang'a became Presiding Bishop in 2024**.
