+⭐ **So the succession is a 1970 American consecration in PECUSA, and the jurisdiction a 1992 American separation from PECUSA.** ⛔ **There is no point in that chain at which an English archiepiscopal determination of 1899 attaches, and no English province in the line.** ⚠️ **This corroborates from the EMC's own side what `St_Francis_EMC_Distinctives.md` already records about the EMC as a Continuing Anglican body incorporated 1992 out of the Episcopal Synod of America. ⛔ It is registered here as external research about the EMC as an institution, and is NOT a finding about Rev. James.**
